# ZERO-TRADE

A virtual trading and financial education Android app built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.

## Purpose
ZERO-TRADE is a training-first platform for learning financial markets without using real money. It provides comprehensive financial education with virtual trading simulation.

## Key Features

### Virtual Trading
- Starting virtual balance: ₹3,00,000
- Real trading is completely disabled
- Educational focus only
- Subscription model: ₹23 per ₹1,00,000 used after initial balance consumed

### Multi-Language Support
- ಕನ್ನಡ (Kannada)
- हिन्दी (Hindi)
- English
- తెలుగు (Telugu)
- தமிழ் (Tamil)
- മലയാളം (Malayalam)
- मराठी (Marathi)
- ગુજરાતી (Gujarati)

### Educational Modules
- NIFTY 50 Basics
- Call & Put Options
- Technical Indicators (RSI, MACD, MA, Bollinger Bands, ATR)
- Risk Management
- Candlestick Reading
- Virtual Trading Demo

### Market Learning
- NIFTY 50 Index
- Cryptocurrencies (BTC, ETH)
- Commodities (Gold, Silver)
- Stocks (Indian Market)
- Forex
- Option Chain Analysis

### Additional Features
- Text-to-Speech (TTS) audio guidance in all languages
- User authentication and profiles
- Portfolio tracking
- Bottom navigation for easy access
- Donation section for charitable causes
- Modern Material Design 3 UI
- Virtual-only trading simulation

## Tech Stack
- **Language**: Kotlin
- **UI Framework**: Jetpack Compose
- **Design System**: Material 3
- **Navigation**: Navigation Compose
- **Data Storage**: DataStore Preferences
- **Text-to-Speech**: Android TTS
- **Architecture**: MVVM pattern

