## Getting Started

### Prerequisites
- Android Studio (latest version)
- Kotlin 1.9.20 or higher
- Android SDK 34
- Minimum API Level: 26

### Installation
1. Clone the repository
2. Open the project in Android Studio
3. Sync Gradle
4. Run on emulator or physical device

### App Flow
1. **Splash Screen** - ZERO-TRADE branding (1.8s)
2. **Language Selection** - Choose preferred language
3. **Login/Registration** - Create or login to account
4. **Dashboard** - Main navigation hub
5. **Markets** - View live market data (mock)
6. **Education** - Learning modules
7. **Portfolio** - Track virtual positions
8. **Settings** - Language, theme, voice preferences
9. **Donation** - Support charitable causes

## Important Disclaimer
⚠️ **THIS APP IS FOR EDUCATIONAL PURPOSES ONLY**
- No real money is involved
- No actual trading takes place
- All data is simulated/mock data
- This is NOT a real trading platform
- Use this to learn market concepts and practice trading strategy

## Subscription Model
- First ₹3,00,000 virtual balance: FREE
- After balance consumed: ₹23 per ₹1,00,000
- Example: Using ₹1,00,000 = ₹23 charge

